      <title>Oversea download マンガワン (MANGA ONE) App</title>
      <link href="/2025/04/17/Oversea-download-MANGA-ONE-App/"/>
      <url>/2025/04/17/Oversea-download-MANGA-ONE-App/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="マンガワン-MANGA-ONE"><a href="#マンガワン-MANGA-ONE" class="headerlink" title="マンガワン(MANGA ONE)"></a><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=jp.co.comic.mangaone&amp;hl=en">マンガワン(MANGA ONE)</a></h1><p>Benefits:<br><br><img src="https://i.ibb.co/Cs30DwHW/h2.jpg" style="width:450px ;height:auto;"><br><img src="https://i.ibb.co/WpBbvhP0/h1.jpg" style="width:450px ;height:auto;"><br></p><ul><li><p>Red heart (free life): unlock chapters (except the latest chapter.).<br></p>  <img src="https://i.ibb.co/vxL9KH5P/q1.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"></li><li><p>Green heart (sp life): unlock latest chapters or extra chapters.<br></p>  <img src="https://i.ibb.co/5hNFV94x/q2.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;">  - Green heart (sp life): Can be refilled by logging in daily or watching an ad video(2 times/day).<br>  <img src="https://i.ibb.co/JWgM2B93/q4.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"></li><li><p>Yellow coin (purchased coins): Used to buy the manga VOL.<br><br>  <img src="https://i.ibb.co/q3n5Xy7c/q3.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><br></p></li></ul><h2 id="Caution"><a href="#Caution" class="headerlink" title="Caution!"></a>Caution!</h2><ol><li>Age above 19.</li><li>Not risk-free.</li><li>Google only allows users to change their country setting in the Google Play Store once every 12 months.</li></ol><h2 id="Preparation"><a href="#Preparation" class="headerlink" title="Preparation"></a>Preparation</h2><ol><li>Own bank card. (To set up a new country or region, you must have a payment method.)</li><li>Create a new google account with only basic info. (You can’t use an existing account as it contains your actual location information)</li></ol><h2 id="Download-VPN"><a href="#Download-VPN" class="headerlink" title="Download VPN"></a>Download VPN</h2><ol><li>Free 1hr Japan VPN: <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=vpn.japan&amp;hl=en">VPN Japan - get Japanese IP</a>. ()<br></li><li>Open and run the Japan VPN, connect to a Japan server.</li></ol><h2 id="Create-a-Japan-Google-Play-Account-DETAILS"><a href="#Create-a-Japan-Google-Play-Account-DETAILS" class="headerlink" title="Create a Japan Google Play Account (DETAILS)"></a>Create a Japan Google Play Account (<a href="https://www.vpnmentor.com/blog/how-to-access-japanese-google-play-store-from-anywhere/#:~:text=You%20can't%20usually%20access,Japanese%20Google%20Play%20Store%20anywhere.">DETAILS</a>)</h2><ol><li>Clear data and cache of Google Play Store <br><br>Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Google Play Store &gt; Storage &gt; Clear data &gt; clear cache </li><li>Log in new google account into your device. <br><br>Settings &gt; Google &gt; Add another account &gt; Follow the instruction<ul><li>You can’t use an existing account as it contains your actual location information</li></ul></li><li>REQUIRE a payment method from the new country.<ul><li>To set up a new country or region, you must have a payment method.</li><li>Add credit or debit card. (Not risk-free)</li></ul></li><li>Once the page turn Japanese, it’s successful!</li></ol><h2 id="Download-Manga-One"><a href="#Download-Manga-One" class="headerlink" title="Download Manga One"></a>Download Manga One</h2><ol><li>Search “Manga One”<br></li></ol><img src="https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jQLx-yAeO1YsIXW7KN0n-zVt2Txq4VdCEmhsG-bFV7oV5KfWiX7mRkLXLNjcgAB73MI=w480-h960-rw" alt="SHOGAKUKAN INC - Manga One Logo 2025" style="width:auto ;height:100px;"><ol start="2"><li>Download</li><li>Log In/Sign Up<br></li></ol><img src="https://i.ibb.co/TqWWJ00c/1.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/RTKB5MG2/2.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/zWBgB3jJ/3.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/hxq2fx3d/3-1.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><h2 id="Top-Up"><a href="#Top-Up" class="headerlink" title="Top Up"></a>Top Up</h2><img src="https://i.ibb.co/N2BmC54p/p1.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/qLdq7W7v/p2.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/4ZZk8ZJ4/p4.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><h2 id="Delete-payment-method"><a href="#Delete-payment-method" class="headerlink" title="Delete payment method."></a>Delete payment method.</h2><ol><li>Google Play Store <br><ul><li>Profile (Top right) &gt; Payments and subscriptions &gt; Payment methods &gt; More payment settiings <br></li></ul></li></ol><img src="https://i.ibb.co/qLzZPtzC/r1.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/tpTFCYwQ/r2.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/5XbmnRG8/r3.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/qMDNJ0Zy/r4.jpg" style="width:auto ;height:450px;"><ol start="2"><li>Google account <br><ul><li>REMOVE the cards.</li></ul></li></ol><h1 id="Enjoy-the-manga"><a href="#Enjoy-the-manga" class="headerlink" title="Enjoy the manga! :)"></a>Enjoy the manga! :)</h1>]]></content>
      
      
      
