      <url>/2025/04/16/Tidio-x-HEXO/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="How-to-implement-Tidio-into-HEXO"><a href="#How-to-implement-Tidio-into-HEXO" class="headerlink" title="How to implement Tidio into HEXO"></a>How to implement <a href="https://www.tidio.com/?a_bucket=sem&amp;a_source=google&amp;a_g_campaignid=17117016871&amp;a_g_keyword=tidio&amp;a_g_creative=701095043432&amp;a_type=brand&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=17117016871&amp;utm_term=tidio&amp;hsa_acc=1286770856&amp;hsa_cam=17117016871&amp;hsa_grp=137849944682&amp;hsa_ad=701095043432&amp;hsa_src=g&amp;hsa_tgt=kwd-111279180878&amp;hsa_kw=tidio&amp;hsa_mt=b&amp;hsa_net=adwords&amp;hsa_ver=3&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwh_i_BhCzARIsANimeoG1tRi6EJblpbXjq3AXLscBny67WgMFKCclbLsrqc5p9RDXhKXAA6waAkqsEALw_wcB">Tidio</a> into HEXO</h1><h2 id="1-Get-private-key"><a href="#1-Get-private-key" class="headerlink" title="1. Get private key"></a>1. Get private key</h2><p>Setting &gt; Developer &gt; Project data &gt; <a href="https://www.tidio.com/panel/settings/developer/developerData">Public key</a></p><h2 id="2-config-yml-add-this"><a href="#2-config-yml-add-this" class="headerlink" title="2. _config.yml add this"></a>2. _config.yml add this</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">tidio:</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="built_in">enable</span>: <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  key: <span class="comment">#public key</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h2 id="3-head-ejs"><a href="#3-head-ejs" class="headerlink" title="3. head.ejs"></a>3. head.ejs</h2><p>File path: C:\project_name\themes\hexo-theme-matery\layout_partial\head.ejs</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&lt;<span class="built_in">head</span>&gt;</span><br><span class="line">&lt;!-- 最下面加上 --&gt;</span><br><span class="line">&lt;script src=<span class="string">"//code.tidio.co/YOUR_PUBLIC_KEY.js"</span> async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</span><br><span class="line">&lt;/head&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>]]></content>
      
      
      
